(STATEMENT OF MAIN TERMS OF EMPLOYMENT - PRIVATE AND CONFIDENTIAL) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (Employer:       Kestrel Bay Supplies Ltd, 14 Quayside Lane, Bristol BS1 6XJ) Tj
T* (Employee:       Daniel James Hughes) Tj
T* (Home address:   Flat 3, 41 Ashgrove Road, Bedminster, Bristol BS3 3JP) Tj
