T* () Tj
T* (1. Job title and duties) Tj
T* (   Customer Support Advisor, reporting to the Customer Support Lead \(Megan Tulloch\).) Tj
T* (   You will answer customer enquiries by phone, email and live chat, process) Tj
T* (   returns and warranty claims, and keep help-centre articles up to date.) Tj
T* (2. Start date) Tj
T* (   Your employment starts on 3 November 2025. No previous employment counts) Tj
T* (   towards your period of continuous employment.) Tj
T* (3. Probation) Tj
T* (   3 months. During probation either side may end employment with one week's notice.) Tj
T* (4. Place of work) Tj
T* (   14 Quayside Lane, Bristol. After probation you may work from home up to 2 days a) Tj
T* (   week under the Hybrid Working Policy.) Tj
T* (5. Hours) Tj
T* (   37.5 hours a week, Monday to Friday, on a rota between 08:00 and 18:00.) Tj
T* (   Occasional Saturday cover \(09:00-13:00\) in peak season, paid at time and a half.) Tj
T* (6. Pay) Tj
T* (   25,400 GBP a year, paid monthly in arrears on the last working day of the month) Tj
T* (   by credit transfer. Salaries are reviewed each July.) Tj
T* (7. Holiday) Tj
T* (   25 days a year plus UK bank holidays. The holiday year runs January to December.) Tj
T* (   3 days must be kept for the Christmas shutdown.) Tj
T* (8. Sickness) Tj
T* (   Statutory Sick Pay applies. After probation, company sick pay is full pay for up) Tj
T* (   to 10 days in any rolling 12 months.) Tj
T* (9. Pension) Tj
T* (   Auto-enrolment in the company scheme: employer 5%, employee 3% of qualifying) Tj
T* (   earnings.) Tj
T* (10. Notice) Tj
T* (   After probation: one month from either side, rising to one week per complete) Tj
T* (   year of service after 4 years \(maximum 12 weeks\).) Tj
T* (11. Confidentiality and data protection) Tj
T* (   You must keep customer and company information confidential during and after) Tj
T* (   your employment, and follow the Data Retention Policy and the IT Security Policy.) Tj
T* (12. Disciplinary and grievance) Tj
T* (   See the Employee Handbook, sections 9 and 10. These procedures are not) Tj
T* (   contractual.) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (Signed for the employer:  Sarah Whitlock, Operations & People Manager) Tj
T* (Signed by the employee:   D. J. Hughes                 Date: 9 October 2025) Tj
